		<content type="html" xml:base="http://localhost/opengd77/viewtopic.php?t=3804&amp;p=37171#p37171"><![CDATA[
250 mW I think is not the limit. RD-5R has a problem with the sound of a motor boat in the DMR, it manifests itself at maximum power. It is necessary to disassemble and measure which stabilizer sags during transmission. I think this is the problem of this radio. Users without experience in radio electronics should not install firmware with an access point. I think I will conduct an experiment in the next few days and will report the result.<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=8592">UR6LRD</a> — Mon May 19, 2025 8:11 am</p><hr />
]]></content>
